WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Select a part and choose Pin

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Place a fixed point

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Switch to rotation

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.042
Motion replay: rotate while the hard pin stays fixed in world space.

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:14.042
4. Check the pin after posing

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:17.042
5. Manage the fixed point and save
